# PMS UI rules

- This is the staff ops app only. Do not build public guest browse/book flows here.
- Call `apps/api` for all data. No direct OTA integrations in the browser.
- Prioritize calendar, reservations, check-in/out, and quick-confirm over marketing UI.
- Quick-confirm = review pre-filled draft → Confirm → persist. Minimize typing.
- Show role-appropriate UI (admin vs front desk).
- Be honest about iCal delay; never claim zero double-booking.
- Keep ops screens dense and actionable; avoid landing-page decoration.
- Also read `apps/pms/AGENTS.md` when working here.
